1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,900
Still managing your HOA with chats, spreadsheets, and manual reminders? Meet HOAConnect.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,900
HOAConnect brings payments, announcements, waste collection, reports, and homeowners into one simple platform.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,900
Each user gets the right experience: homeowners, collectors, and administrators all have their own dashboard.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,900
Homeowners can see dues, amount paid, announcements, property details, and the next collection schedule at a glance.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,900
Smart notifications keep the community informed about trash collection, billing reminders, and important updates.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,900
Payment history is clear, searchable, and easy to understand, with paid, unpaid, and overdue records in one place.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,900
Announcements are organized by urgency, billing, and general updates, so homeowners never miss what matters.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,900
Residents can submit and track reports, including missed collection, road damage, and community concerns.

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,900
Collectors start the day with a live overview of confirmed households, completed stops, route progress, and urgent requests.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,900
The household list shows who is ready, who is pending, and which stop needs action next.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:38,900
Route maps help collectors move through the subdivision with fewer missed stops and better visibility.

12
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:47,900
Urgent pickup requests can be reviewed, approved, declined, and added to today's route.

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:56,900
Completed collections are tracked in real time, giving the team a clean record of finished stops.

14
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:05,900
Admins get a full operating dashboard: households, payment compliance, participation, reports, overdue accounts, and monthly collections.

15
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:14,900
Analytics show collection readiness, payment health, and performance trends for better community decisions.

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:23,900
Payment management helps administrators monitor paid, unpaid, and overdue accounts without manual spreadsheets.

17
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:32,900
Waste collection schedules and readiness confirmations are managed from one HOA-wide view.

18
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:41,900
Reports are prioritized by status and severity, helping admins resolve issues faster.

19
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:50,900
Admins can post announcements and notify all homeowners from one simple composer.

20
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:59,900
Household records show ownership, contacts, zones, occupancy, and payment readiness in a structured table.

21
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:08,900
Subscription, usage, billing history, and plan management are visible inside the admin billing screen.

22
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:17,900
HOAConnect: manage your community, track payments, coordinate collections, and stay connected. Try before purchase.

